parameters.help_en:
The task parameters. The value is a JSON string that varies based on the value of TaskType.

If TaskType is set to 1, specify the ID of the Anti-DDoS Pro instance export rules you want to export. Example: {"instanceId": "ddoscoo-cn-XXXXX"}
If TaskType is set to 2, specify an empty object string. Example: {}
If TaskType is set to 3, specify the ID of the Anti-DDoS Pro instance export rules you want to export. Example: {"instanceId": "ddoscoo-cn-XXXXX"}
If TaskType is set to 4, specify the ID of the Anti-DDoS Pro instance export rules you want to export. Example: {"instanceId": "ddoscoo-cn-XXXXX"}

